&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Postscript is the AI messaging platform trusted by 20,000+ Shopify brands — including Brooklinen, Ruggable, True Classic, and Dr. Squatch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a mission to make SMS your number one revenue driving channel, we built the best-in-class SMS marketing platform and launched revenue-driving AI features not available on any other platform. And we&#39;re just getting started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Greylock and Y Combinator, fully remote since 2018.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Representative (BDR)&lt;/strong&gt; at Postscript, you&#39;ll be on the front lines, identifying, engaging, and making initial connections with ecommerce businesses ready to unlock significant growth through SMS. You&#39;ll be a vital ambassador for our brand, product, and company, playing a direct role in our continued success. Your day-to-day will involve building targeted account lists, sparking new opportunities through thoughtful and creative outreach, and ensuring a smooth hand-off to our Account Executives once you&#39;ve qualified the prospect.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fully remote opportunity, offering you the flexibility to work from anywhere in North America.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Primary duties&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and qualify&lt;/strong&gt; ecommerce brands that align with our ideal customer profile and demonstrate a strong potential for growth with Postscript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consistently achieve and exceed&lt;/strong&gt; your targets for generating qualified new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skillfully utilize&lt;/strong&gt; a range of tools and technologies to research, identify, and connect with potential customers. You&#39;ll be encouraged to think creatively and resourcefully in your outreach efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professionally represent&lt;/strong&gt; Postscript&#39;s product, brand, and company in every interaction, clearly and concisely articulating how we can help ecommerce businesses thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain exceptional standards&lt;/strong&gt; for timeliness, responsiveness, and diligent follow-up with prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accurately manage&lt;/strong&gt; your activities and pipeline within Salesforce CRM, ensuring all sales data is consistently updated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build foundational relationships&lt;/strong&gt; with prospective customers, setting the stage for their future success with Postscript. You&#39;ll work closely with Account Executives to collaboratively nurture these early-stage opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuously learn&lt;/strong&gt; about our customers&#39; marketing strategies, technology landscape, and broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with&lt;/strong&gt; members of the Go-to-Market (GTM) team to contribute to the refinement of our sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enhanced Personalization:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI tools to analyze prospect data (e.g., LinkedIn activity, earnings reports, or tech stack changes) to craft hyper-personalized outreach at scale, moving beyond generic templates to drive higher response rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize AI-powered sales tools to automate administrative tasks—such as CRM data entry, meeting summarization, and lead prioritization—freeing up more time for high-value strategic research and live prospect engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We’ll Love About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of B2B sales development experience, preferably in a SaaS, marketing technology, or a related domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a variety of sales tools such as Salesforce, Outreach, Sales Navigator, or Gong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a natural ability to build rapport and make initial connections with people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You pay close attention to details and approach tasks in an organized and solution-oriented way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re developing your ability to prioritize tasks and think strategically about engaging with different businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re eager to learn how to create value for customers and understand their business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re motivated to meet and exceed expectations and have a genuine desire to learn and grow in a sales role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in or basic understanding of ecommerce is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Love About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary of &lt;strong&gt;USD&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;$50,000&lt;/strong&gt; plus uncapped variable and significant equity regardless of location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High growth startup - plenty of room for you to directly impact the company and grow your career!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote team - work from home (or wherever!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun - We’re passionate and enjoy what we do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For information about how we use your personal data, please see our U.S. Job Applicant &lt;a href=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how we use your personal data, please see our U.S. Job Applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are welcome here. Postscript is an ever-evolving place of equal employment for talented individuals.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Postscript is the AI messaging platform trusted by 20,000+ Shopify brands — including Brooklinen, Ruggable, True Classic, and Dr. Squatch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a mission to make SMS your number one revenue driving channel, we built the best-in-class SMS marketing platform and launched revenue-driving AI features not available on any other platform. And we&#39;re just getting started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Greylock and Y Combinator, fully remote since 2018.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Director, Email Deliverability&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Postscript is the AI messaging platform trusted by 20,000+ Shopify brands — including Brooklinen, Ruggable, True Classic, and Dr. Squatch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We built the best-in-class SMS marketing platform and the revenue-driving AI features no other platform offers — and now we&#39;re bringing that same obsession to email. As we expand into a true multi-channel platform for high-growth DTC brands, getting every message to the inbox is mission-critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Greylock and Y Combinator, fully remote since 2018.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Director, Email Deliverability&lt;/strong&gt; at Postscript, you&#39;ll own the strategy, infrastructure, and sender reputation that get our customers&#39; email to the primary inbox. This is a foundational, hands-on leadership role: you&#39;ll build Postscript&#39;s email deliverability function from the ground up — IP and domain architecture, authentication standards, reputation monitoring, and mailbox-provider relationships — while serving as the trusted deliverability advisor our brands rely on as they migrate and scale their email programs on Postscript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Product and Engineering to shape the deliverability tooling and infrastructure our platform is built on, and with Customer Success and Support to keep our customers&#39; programs healthy. You&#39;ll set the standard for how 20,000+ brands reach the inbox — and as the function grows, you&#39;ll build and lead the team behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fully remote position and can be based in the US or Canada.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliverability Strategy &amp;amp; Sender Reputation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Postscript&#39;s end-to-end email deliverability strategy — IP pool architecture, domain strategy, and shared vs. dedicated sending models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage IP and domain warming programs that get new senders to volume quickly and safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce authentication standards (SPF, DKIM, DMARC, BIMI) and DMARC alignment across customer sending domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor sender reputation, inbox placement, and blocklist activity, and lead rapid remediation when issues arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep Postscript ahead of evolving mailbox-provider requirements — Gmail, Yahoo, and Microsoft bulk-sender rules, spam-rate thresholds, and one-click unsubscribe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Deliverability &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior deliverability expert for our brands — auditing programs, diagnosing inbox-placement issues, and building remediation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead deliverability onboarding for brands migrating their email to Postscript, including reputation transfer and warming strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex deliverability concepts into clear, actionable guidance that marketers can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own escalations, partnering with customers to protect and grow their inbox placement and sending reputation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Foundation-Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to build the deliverability tooling, monitoring, and infrastructure that power the platform — and influence the roadmap with deliverability requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the playbooks, processes, and standards that scale deliverability across thousands of senders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish feedback loops (FBLs), Postmaster Tools, and reporting that give customers and internal teams visibility into deliverability health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As the function matures, hire, mentor, and lead a team of deliverability specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain expert-level knowledge of the deliverability landscape and represent Postscript in the broader community (e.g., M3AAWG, emailgeeks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and steward relationships with mailbox providers and industry partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Postscript&#39;s sending practices and customer programs stay compliant with CAN-SPAM, GDPR, and mailbox-provider policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and internal systems to scale deliverability monitoring, diagnostics, and customer guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;ll Love About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of dedicated email deliverability experience, ideally at an ESP, CDP, or high-volume sending platform (e.g., SendGrid/Twilio, Attentive, Braze, Klaviyo, Iterable, Validity/Return Path).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical command of email authentication (SPF, DKIM, DMARC, BIMI), IP and domain warming, sender reputation, and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience owning deliverability for bulk/high-volume senders, including diagnosing and remediating blocklistings and inbox-placement problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with Google Postmaster Tools, Yahoo Sender Hub, and the 2024+ Gmail/Yahoo/Microsoft bulk-sender requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with mailbox providers and/or active participation in the deliverability community (M3AAWG, emailgeeks, etc.) strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultant&#39;s instinct — you can translate deep technical detail into strategy that non-technical marketers understand and act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Player-coach mindset: happy to do the hands-on work today and build the playbooks (and eventually the team) for tomorrow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of e-commerce/DTC brands and how email drives revenue (e-commerce experience strongly preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building from scratch in a fast-paced, early-stage environment, with a growth mindset toward AI and emerging tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills, with high reliability and outstanding follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Love About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to build a function from the ground floor and define how 20,000+ brands reach the inbox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-growth startup environment with opportunities to make a meaningful impact and grow your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote work culture – work from anywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun, collaborative team passionate about e-commerce and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off to recharge and prioritize your well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health, dental, vision insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how we use your personal data, please see our U.S. Job Applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are welcome here. Postscript is an ever-evolving place of equal employment for talented individuals.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Postscript is the AI messaging platform trusted by 20,000+ Shopify brands — including Brooklinen, Ruggable, True Classic, and Dr. Squatch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a mission to make SMS your number one revenue driving channel, we built the best-in-class SMS marketing platform and launched revenue-driving AI features not available on any other platform. And we&#39;re just getting started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Greylock and Y Combinator, fully remote since 2018.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Postscript is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Customer Success Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as our subject matter expert and internal champion for email strategy. This is not a traditional CSM role — it sits at the intersection of customer success, enablement, and program development. You&#39;ll operate as a strategic overlay across our email book of business while also doing the foundational work of building what a great email customer journey looks like at Postscript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll carry a book of business while simultaneously building the playbooks and enablement materials that will scale what you learn to the broader CSM team. The right person has been a strong CSM, but has also led programs, built assets others use, and influenced strategy beyond their own accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position that can be based anywhere in the US or Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Email Customer Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll be the primary CSM for our early email merchants — the ones helping us learn what good looks like. That means managing relationships, driving adoption, navigating ambiguity, and feeding what you learn directly into the frameworks others will eventually follow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Email Customer Journey &amp;amp; Playbooks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll define what a successful email customer journey looks like at Postscript — from implementation through expansion — and turn that into repeatable, documented motions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable the CS Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll partner with the enablement team to help build materials, training resources, and internal documentation that upskill the CS org based on your proposed email strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Feedback &amp;amp; Roadmap Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll be the connective tissue between the front lines and Product. That means clearly articulating adoption friction, the merchant impact of product gaps, and the downstream effect on retention — with enough specificity to actually influence roadmap prioritization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with data and own internal reporting on your book of business. You also leverage data-driven insights directly with customers to help them optimize and expand their email use case.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’ll Love About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve been a strong, customer-facing CSM — ideally focused on email — and you&#39;ve also built things: playbooks, training materials, onboarding programs, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong point of view on what good email strategy looks like for ecommerce brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a project management mindset; you can hold a complex workstream together while still being present for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked in or alongside alpha/beta programs and helped them scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly (written, verbal) across multiple levels and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don&#39;t need a fully defined path to do great work — you&#39;re energized by building in ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Love About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary range of USD $117,000-$141,000 base plus variable compensation &amp;amp; significant equity (we do not have geo based salaries)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High growth startup - plenty of room for you to directly impact the company and grow your career!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from home (or wherever)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun - We’re passionate and enjoy what we do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and opportunity for equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, dental, vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how we use your personal data, please see our U.S. Job Applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://postscript.io/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are welcome here. Postscript is an ever-evolving place of equal employment for talented individuals.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Postscript is the AI messaging platform trusted by 20,000+ Shopify brands — including Brooklinen, Ruggable, True Classic, and Dr. Squatch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a mission to make SMS your number one revenue driving channel, we built the best-in-class SMS marketing platform and launched revenue-driving AI features not available on any other platform. And we&#39;re just getting started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Greylock and Y Combinator, fully remote since 2018.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Sales Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; at Postscript, you will collaborate closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, Engineering and, of course, our customers to help our customers bring their conversational commerce vision to life. You will work with AEs and prospects to demo advanced use cases and successfully manage proof of concepts. You will work with our CSMs and Onboarding teams to ensure our customers can turn those proof of concepts into reliable, scalable SMS and email strategies. Serve as a trusted technical advisor throughout all customer lifecycles, instilling confidence in prospects and customers by showcasing a deep understanding of both the product and the customer&#39;s business needs. Build a strong technical grasp of the Postscript platform, including its integrations and API capabilities, to provide well-rounded solutions for diverse use cases. You&#39;ll be the link between GTM and Product, ensuring that customers&#39; requests are well documented and prioritized. As a Sales Engineering team member, you&#39;ll also help create our solutions engineering playbooks and processes, with ample opportunity for career growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position that can be based anywhere in the US or Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert on the Postscript platform, understanding all officially and unofficially supported use cases in detail and imagining what&#39;s possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers and prospects extend their strategy into email alongside SMS, and contribute to shaping best practices as this is a newer, evolving part of the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to accelerate discovery calls, demo prep, and technical content creation — and help customers understand how Postscript&#39;s own AI features can drive their results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales team in helping prospects understand what they can achieve with Postscript and successfully winning those customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technical discovery calls with prospects, offering creative solutions, discussing competitive landscape, and documenting new requests for Postscript&#39;s Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with account executives to prepare demos to showcase advanced capabilities of the Postscript platform and integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute the delivery of POCs for customers and prospects that have more complex use cases, collaborating with Postscript&#39;s onboarding and engineering teams as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer support and guidance to customers and partners looking to use our APIs for both standardized and custom product integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating technical content to show customers how to implement specific use cases or standard methodologies for new features, integrations, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support and troubleshooting assistance to our onboarding and customer support teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a creative problem solver, developing innovative solutions for unique customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partners building technical integrations with Postscript, serving as a point of contact to answer questions, provide guidance, and ensure a seamless integration that enhances the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partners building technical integrations with Postscript, serving as a point of contact to answer questions, provide guidance, and ensure a seamless integration that enhances the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;ll Love About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least 3 years in a revenue-driving, customer-facing technical role — solutions engineer, sales engineer, support engineer, or related&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ecommerce knowledge &amp;amp; past experience required, Shopify ecosystem highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with top-tier Shopify/ecommerce brands (enterprise in this space typically means high-GMV DTC or omnichannel retailers — not Fortune 500 scale)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You exemplify a &quot;customer first&quot; attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technical, comfortable with front end web technologies (JavaScript, CSS, etc.) and can create proof of concept product integrations using well-documented APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re genuinely energized by AI — not just open to it, but excited by where it&#39;s headed. At Postscript, this isn&#39;t optional: we build our product with AI, sell AI-powered features, and use AI daily in how we work. You already use AI tools in your own workflow, you can speak to AI capabilities with real credibility in front of a prospect, and you&#39;d rather be experimenting with what&#39;s possible than waiting to be told it&#39;s safe to try&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Email marketing platform experience is a plus, especially if you&#39;ve navigated deliverability, segmentation, or cross-channel orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are detail-oriented, naturally curious, and strive to be an expert in anything you spend time on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a strong cross-functional collaborator who can navigate relationships with Product and Engineering independently, not just alongside a manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an excellent communicator, able to quickly translate complex technical ideas for both technical and non-technical audiences, on the fly, in remote and in-person settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well under pressure and can confidently present to both executive and day-to-day stakeholders at our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable wading through the unknown — investigating and verifying answers to complex, undocumented questions is energizing to you, not draining&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Love About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary range of USD $120,000-$140,000 base plus variable compensation &amp;amp; significant equity (we do not do geo based salaries)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High growth startup - plenty of room for you to directly impact the company and grow your career!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from home (or wherever)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun - We’re passionate and enjoy what we do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and opportunity for equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
